                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 6.1 - Recognition and Representation",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                281,
                663,
                310
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    135.0,
                    281.0
                ],
                [
                    663.0,
                    281.0
                ],
                [
                    663.0,
                    310.0
                ],
                [
                    135.0,
                    310.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Employer will recognize the Union as the exclusive representative of all Employees. This includes the Union's right to be represented in negotiations, formal discussions and meetings between Employees and the Employer, with regard to matters affecting conditions of employment concerning grievances, personnel policies and practices or other matters affecting general working conditions. This would include Agency sponsored Committees/Meetings dealing with the above subjects.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                336,
                1070,
                508
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    336.0
                ],
                [
                    1070.0,
                    336.0
                ],
                [
                    1070.0,
                    508.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    508.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The right of the Union to be present does not extend to informal discussions or discussions involving an Employee’s performance counseling.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                530,
                1016,
                589
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    530.0
                ],
                [
                    1016.0,
                    530.0
                ],
                [
                    1016.0,
                    589.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    589.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Employer will recognize all Local Union Officers and Representatives designated by the Union:",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                613,
                963,
                672
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    613.0
                ],
                [
                    963.0,
                    613.0
                ],
                [
                    963.0,
                    672.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    672.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The Union will supply the Employer, in writing, and will maintain on a current basis, a list of the Union Officers and Representatives. Copies of the list will be furnished to the HRO-LR.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                698,
                1021,
                782
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    698.0
                ],
                [
                    1021.0,
                    698.0
                ],
                [
                    1021.0,
                    782.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    782.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The Agency acknowledges that the Union’s primary point of contact for all Union matters is the LIUNA Local State Representative for the State of Michigan, or any other representative designated by the LIUNA.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                808,
                1076,
                895
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    808.0
                ],
                [
                    1076.0,
                    808.0
                ],
                [
                    1076.0,
                    895.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    895.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. The Employer agrees that it shall not interfere in internal business matters between the Union and Employees while in a non-duty status (including the solicitation of membership, elections of labor organization officials, and collection of dues).",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                921,
                1069,
                1006
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    921.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    921.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    1006.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    1006.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. The Employer agrees that there will be no restraint, interference, coercion or discrimination against Union representatives while performing their authorized duties under the Statute.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                1031,
                1048,
                1115
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    1031.0
                ],
                [
                    1048.0,
                    1031.0
                ],
                [
                    1048.0,
                    1115.0
                ],
                [
                    130.0,
                    1115.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. The Union, in consonance with its right to represent, may propose new policy, changes in policy, or resolutions to issues, involving local conditions of employment or working conditions. This right shall apply at all levels of management within the Agency and the Union, starting with the Steward and the first level Supervisor. This paragraph does not create a separate duty to negotiate.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                1142,
                1075,
                1284
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    1142.0
                ],
                [
                    1075.0,
                    1142.0
                ],
                [
                    1075.0,
                    1284.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    1284.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The Union’s primary Agency point of contact will be the Human Resources Office (HRO) Labor Relations (LR) representative. However, some matters may require the Union to have direct interaction with the Adjutant General (Agency Head) or designated representative from the Agency’s Senior Staff (Chief of Staff or above). When such",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                1308,
                1076,
                1422
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    1308.0
                ],
